{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22244","headline":"对酒示行简 · 白居易","name":"对酒示行简","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今旦一尊酒，欢畅何怡怡。\n此乐从中来，他人安得知。\n兄弟唯二人，远别恒苦悲。\n今春自巴峡，万里平安归。\n复有双幼妹，笄年未结褵。\n昨日嫁娶毕，良人皆可依。\n忧念两消释，如刀断羁縻。\n身轻心无系，忽欲凌空飞。\n人生苟有累，食肉常如饥。\n我心既无苦，饮水亦可肥。\n行简劝尔酒，停杯听我辞。\n不叹乡国远，不嫌官禄微。\n但愿我与尔，终老不相离。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}